    // 9 October 2026 : the RIGHT slope had no front (+Z) and no back (-Z) face (its front edge quad ran along the slope's lower end instead), so the deck edge was open and you saw through it. FR : la pente droite n'avait ni face avant ni face arriere.
    add_quad(0, r3_t, r0_t, r0_b, r3_b, \"group_trim\", pid);
